SUMMARY:Carnival of Panagia and Potamia
LOCATION:Panagia\, Thasos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Thasos's carnival is concentrated in the neighbouring villages of Panagia and Potamia on the last carnival weekend: satirical floats\, plenty of food and wine\, dancing and the burning of the carnival effigy\, then kites and Lenten food on Clean Monday. Potamia also revives the 'Anavrochiaris' rain custom at the end of August (30-31 Aug 2026).\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/thasos/#panagia-carnival-of-panagia-and-potamia
